<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">HOJA DE RUTA</div><h1 class="page-title"><%= @departure.code %></h1><p class="subtitle"><%= @departure.bus.name %> · salida <%= l @departure.departs_at, format: :long %></p></div><div class="flex gap-2"><%= link_to "CSV", departure_manifest_path(@departure, format: :csv), class: "btn" %><%= link_to "PDF", departure_manifest_path(@departure, format: :pdf), class: "btn" %></div></div>
<div class="notice mb-5">Los cambios se guardan en una cola local si perdés conexión y se sincronizan al volver. Ante un conflicto se conserva el dato del servidor para revisión.</div>
<div class="space-y-5" data-controller="boarding" data-boarding-sync-url-value="<%= sync_departure_boarding_events_path(@departure) %>"><% @stops.each do |stop| %><section class="card"><div class="card-header"><div><h2 class="font-black"><%= stop.position %>. <%= stop.published_name %></h2><p class="text-xs text-muted"><%= stop.published_address %> · <%= l stop.scheduled_at, format: :short %></p></div><span class="pill pill-blue"><%= stop.passengers.size %> pasajeros</span></div><div class="card-body grid gap-3"><% stop.passengers.each do |passenger| %><article class="grid gap-3 rounded-xl border border-line p-4 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr_auto]"><div><strong><%= passenger.full_name %></strong><small class="block text-muted">DNI <%= passenger.masked_document %> · <%= passenger.room_type %></small></div><div class="text-sm"><span class="text-muted">Hotel</span><strong class="block"><%= passenger.accommodation.name %></strong></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2" data-passenger-id="<%= passenger.id %>" data-version="<%= passenger.lock_version %>"><% [["Pendiente", "pending"], ["Embarcado", "boarded"], ["Ausente", "absent"], ["Incidencia", "incident"]].each do |label, status| %><button type="button" class="btn <%= passenger.boarding_status == status ? 'btn-teal' : '' %>" data-action="boarding#mark" data-status="<%= status %>"><%= label %></button><% end %></div></article><% end %></div></section><% end %></div>
